MuA
</para>
</entry><entry>
<para>
<markup><a href="ACAC6A80-7CE0-4CB9-B36C-B2FB6ACAB027.htm#60A36AC05200FA01C4B4163465E678C3"><img src="../media/60A36AC05200FA01C4B4163465E678C3.png" width="17" height="10" align="bottom"></img></a></markup> — shear modulus of network A
</para>
</entry></row>

