LambdaLA
</para>
</entry><entry>
<para>
<markup><a href="ACAC6A80-7CE0-4CB9-B36C-B2FB6ACAB027.htm#03570878309DB2383B5DEA333A446B85"><img src="../media/03570878309DB2383B5DEA333A446B85.png" width="27" height="17" align="middle"></img></a></markup> — limiting chain stretch of network A
